      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The reason I came across this is I was making a localization file format for a world. In order to do interpolation/string formatting, I was writing things like \"Remove {{ playerName }} from team?\" And a few times I mistyped the braces, which caused the whole translation file to fail to load.",
